anching paths through either dungeon themed levels which feature more platforming and deadly traps on top of the normal puzzles, and a Victorian era themed path with less of an emphasis on deadly traps and more on your ability to solve complex puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722440/extras/9903677658720e79bbb15e2c766c2b3a.poster.avif?t=1732131930\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722440/extras/9903677658720e79bbb15e2c766c2b3a.webm?t=1732131930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722440/extras/9903677658720e79bbb15e2c766c2b3a.mp4?t=1732131930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a mind-bending virtual reality experience like no other. Dive into a captivating puzzle platformer where reality is not what it seems. In this game, players wield the extraordinary power to shift seamlessly between two parallel worlds: the normal world and the mirror world.",
